  "notes": "USAGE:\nA compound verb formed from ⟦{追|お}う→追う：02016_ou⟧ (to chase) + かける (to begin/to do toward). More colloquial than ⟦{追|お}う→追う：02016_ou⟧ alone, and emphasizes the active motion of running after something.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{犬|いぬ}→犬：00632_inu⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{追|お}いかける (a dog chases)\n- ⟦{夢|ゆめ}→夢：01519_yume⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{追|お}いかける (to pursue a dream)\n- ⟦{流行|りゅうこう}→流行：03678_ryuukou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{追|お}いかける (to chase trends)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{追|お}う→追う：02016_ou⟧: to chase, to pursue — more general and also used in written language\n- ⟦{追跡|ついせき}→追跡：09722_tsuiseki⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to track, to pursue — more formal, used for investigations or surveillance",
